/* بذر · رشته, v6 — the art and the behaviour of /thread/ (BZR-183, BZR-185, BZR-187).
   v6 tells the page as a story with the app's own seed «بذر» (assets/looks/thread/seed.js: bazr-app's character code,
   bundled; its art, faces, actions and rules, not a copy). The seed is the narrator from the first screen:
     the hero          a small warm glow beats at the person's heart, then opens into the seed, asleep there;
     the three worlds  each world wakes it a little more: in بدن it opens its eyes, in ذهن it looks, in روح it loves;
     «در بذر…»         the three coloured threads run into it and complete it; the person takes it from the heart in a
                       cupped hand, kneels, sets it in a bed of soil, pats the soil around it and stands up (the gesture is
                       tied to the scroll). It stays whole and visible in its bed; a very fine thread runs from the heart
                       to it;
     «مراحل رشد»       it watches its wire plant grow beside it, ریشه → گل, turning to each stage and hopping (the app's own
                       «از ریشه تا گل»); at گل, love;
     the long parts    it sits faint in its bed only where it clears every word, and is hidden everywhere else;
     the end           it stands at the plant's foot, glances at «شروع», then looks at you; a tap makes it react.
   Its position, whether it shows and its face at rest follow the scroll; its acting (time-based, the app's engine)
   plays only on a forward arrival, once the screen has settled and it is in view, and stops when you leave. Under
   «کاهش حرکت» it is still and happy. With no script or no seed.js, v5's tiny glowing seed is drawn instead.
   v5: one long wire, generated here in code, loops around the volume of a standing person. A single large figure stays fixed
   behind the whole page (one canvas, moved by transform and opacity only) and changes with each part:
     the hero          the person, bowed and frazzled inside a skein of loose wire, which unwinds as you scroll while
                       the person straightens up and turns to face you;
     the three worlds  the clear figure, each world's thread coloured in turn (بدن the body, ذهن the head, روح the loose loops);
     «در بذر…»         all three threads meet at the chest; the planting gesture; the plant grows through «مراحل رشد»;
     the long parts    large and faint behind the words, loosening during the method;
     the end           clear again, with its three threads.
   Where CSS scroll-driven animations are missing, the same scroll pass writes --e / --x / --p / --sp / --hp for the CSS.
   One passive scroll listener; layout is measured only on resize. Draws only when something changes, holds still after
   30 s without input, and under «کاهش حرکت» shows each part's state as a calm still. */
